<v Kessers In The Beaver Trilogy>（唱歌）

00:12:37.010 --> 00:12:47.460
<v Starlee Kine>The whole thing is like this. There's a drill team, a ventriloquist act. It's all pretty much what you expect from a small town talent show until the Beaver Kid comes out.
<v Starlee Kine>整个过程都是这样。有仪仗队，有腹语表演。在比弗男孩出场之前，这一切都和你预期的乡镇才艺秀差不多。

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:52.700
<v Vice Principal In The Beaver Trilogy>Ladies and gentleman, Olivia Newton-Don.
<v Vice Principal In The Beaver Trilogy>女士们先生们，奥利维亚·纽顿-唐。

